2026-07-27T11:58:22.2230922Z i /tmp/RtmpnaDSlj/duckdb
2026-07-27T11:58:22.2231373Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T11:58:22.2231786Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T11:58:22.2232241Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T11:58:22.2232877Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T11:58:22.2233835Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T11:58:22.2234921Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
